fineract-kor
Unofficial Korean localization and verification-harness fork of Apache Fineract.

This repository bundles, with modifications, software developed at
The Apache Software Foundation (http://www.apache.org/):

- backend/  Apache Fineract                 (see backend/NOTICE_SOURCE, backend/LICENSE_SOURCE)
- ui/       Apache Fineract Backoffice UI   (see ui/NOTICE, ui/LICENSE)

Modified files are listed in UPSTREAM.md.
